{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0xhemFydXMlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw","type":"series","name":"Lazarus","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/8ViqUWPWh6aPZGQA57FMRVmaXZ1.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fgcSUbheJ2nml1g7y5QNvR4s16d.jpg","description":"In 2052, a Nobel Prize-winning neuroscientist develops a drug called Hapna — a cure-all that has the unexpected side-effect of causing death three years later. In response to this threat, a special force of agents—nicknamed \"Lazarus\"— is assembled to take on the malevolent Skinner.\n\nRated TV-14 · Ended · First aired 6 Apr 2025 · Japan, United States of America · Language: English · 25 min\nStudio: Sola Entertainment, MAPPA, Williams Street · Network: Adult Swim, TV Tokyo\n\nNot complete. On your server: S1 6/13 (missing E7-13)\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2025","genres":["Sci-Fi & Fantasy","Action & Adventure","Animation","English"],"videos":[{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0xhemFydXMlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.1","title":"Goodbye Cruel World","season":1,"episode":1,"released":"2025-04-06T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The miracle drug, Hapna, now threatens to wipe out humanity. A chronic jail-breaker named Axel is asked to find the only man with a cure: Dr. Skinner.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/msD8CqPajMRo3VtRGuh85ZNIPfc.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0xhemFydXMlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.2","title":"Life in the Fast Lane","season":1,"episode":2,"released":"2025-04-13T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Genius hacker Eleina finds a potential lead to Skinner. The Lazarus team splits into two groups to investigate it, but both end up getting shot at.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qMoLjUbiHtE2NeGBabOo25kbrbP.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0xhemFydXMlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.3","title":"Long Way from Home","season":1,"episode":3,"released":"2025-04-20T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Searching Skinner's house and interviewing his old colleague reveals a new lead. Axel and Leland go to Istanbul but have trouble with local thugs.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7totlChbNX9oYF8WaOFrmv7frC7.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0xhemFydXMlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.4","title":"Don't Stop the Dance","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2025-04-27T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The team investigates a club owned by a stockbroker who got rich off Hapna. One of his associates is the hacker Dr. 909, who may be helping Skinner.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bCnBswvlLcDxun2PUUwvhWw2wmz.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0xhemFydXMlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.5","title":"Pretty Vacant","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2025-05-04T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"The team tries to lure Skinner out of hiding with a fake cure staged by the president of Delta Medicinal, but a hacker named Popcorn Wizard butts in.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cPUUaww66P1UTrFAOJZ13V1L1RD.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvRW5nbGlzaC8yMDI1L0xhemFydXMlMjAlMjgyMDI1JTI5Lw.1.6","title":"Heaven Is a Place on Earth","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2025-05-11T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"A secluded commune where Eleina once lived is identified as a potential hiding spot for Skinner. She and Leland infiltrate it to find out for sure.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/y3D43IgXfWHgW3TWl5X6GvIbhuq.jpg"}],"imdbRating":"7.5","runtime":"25 min","cast":["Mamoru Miyano","Makoto Furukawa","Maaya Uchida","Yuma Uchida","Manaka Iwami","Megumi Hayashibara"],"director":["Shinichiro Watanabe"],"released":"2025-04-06T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Getting out of prison was easy. Now he has to save the world.","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"S